    "detailed_description": "Who Is There is a horror first-person shooter designed to instill fear in the player.<br />\r\nYou have to fight the shadows and find a safe place. You need to interact with objects, be careful, explore all corners in order to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFunctions:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLocation exploration - You have to explore the location to find things that will help you survive.<br />\r\nPuzzle Solving - To progress further, you will need to solve problems and puzzles.<br />\r\nAction - Enemies won't let you just pass, and you'll need to fight to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is being developed by one person, and I will be glad for your support.",
